<https://w3id.org/hto/data/published/group/AVI_AVI> rdfs:label "racially and ethnically diverse children and adults, USA (Monell Chemical Senses Center cohort, total N=980), TAS2R38 AVI/AVI" ;
    obo:HTO_0000058 <https://w3id.org/hto/data/published/diplotype/AVI_AVI> ;
    dcterms:source "PMID:20980355" ;
    rdfs:comment "Mennella et al. 2011, Chem Senses 36(2):161-7, doi:10.1093/chemse/bjq106 grouped subjects by TAS2R38 diplotype and compared PROP detection thresholds, but the abstract does not report numeric per-diplotype threshold means or group sample sizes, and the full text is not open access (PMC3020389, isOpenAccess=N), so no reliable numeric value can be sourced. Left unsourced rather than invented." .

